(4520434, 651706, 57886, '<td valign="top">Love the house AND the tree - would love this picture if the tree was more visible BUT I like it like it is :o)</td>', 'Love the house AND the tree - would love this picture if the tree was more visible BUT I like it like it is :o)', '2008-02-27 05:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520441, 650244, 88575, '<td valign="top">Wow.....I can almost see the bicycle flying over the treetops.  Beautiful!!</td>', 'Wow.....I can almost see the bicycle flying over the treetops.  Beautiful!!', '2008-02-27 05:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520456, 650244, 70128, '<td valign="top">i love it, but how about cropping it a little more? just an idea.</td>', 'i love it, but how about cropping it a little more? just an idea.', '2008-02-27 06:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520473, 650353, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great subject! I love the reflection. I''d like a little more depth of field and I think I''d like it better on a fully black backround, i.e. all tiles no white. Very nice shot.</td>', 'Great subject! I love the reflection. I''d like a little more depth of field and I think I''d like it better on a fully black backround, i.e. all tiles no white. Very nice shot.', '2008-02-27 06:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520476, 651596, 88204, '<td valign="top">The web is so subtle it''s almost hard to see. At first glance the roof looks like the subject. That''s good and bad... I like how the web is subtle and makes you look but it may be a tad too subtle because I almost miss it. Interesting use of negative space.</td>', 'The web is so subtle it''s almost hard to see. At first glance the roof looks like the subject. That''s good and bad... I like how the web is subtle and makes you look but it may be a tad too subtle because I almost miss it. Interesting use of negative space.', '2008-02-27 06:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520477, 652070, 88204, '<td valign="top">Nice snow and interesting contrast with weathered cement. I''m not quite sure what to look at. Doesn''t really emphasize black and white to me.</td>', 'Nice snow and interesting contrast with weathered cement. I''m not quite sure what to look at. Doesn''t really emphasize black and white to me.', '2008-02-27 06:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520480, 649962, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great composition and subject! I love how the paper on the left leads me to the cat. Unfortunately the eyes and nose and whiskers are out of focus. That would have made this an 8 but I''m going with a 4 because the focus is so critical to the shot.</td>', 'Great composition and subject! I love how the paper on the left leads me to the cat. Unfortunately the eyes and nose and whiskers are out of focus. That would have made this an 8 but I''m going with a 4 because the focus is so critical to the shot.', '2008-02-27 06:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520481, 649444, 88204, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject. I''m not quite sure what the subject means but it''s interesting visually. The main glass seems a bit out of focus and the tones on the glass aren''t quite rich and smooth enough.</td>', 'Interesting subject. I''m not quite sure what the subject means but it''s interesting visually. The main glass seems a bit out of focus and the tones on the glass aren''t quite rich and smooth enough.', '2008-02-27 06:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520483, 651651, 88204, '<td valign="top">Beautiful snow fall, nice leading lines but I wish the lines lead me to a stronger subject. I''m not quite sure what I should focus on.</td>', 'Beautiful snow fall, nice leading lines but I wish the lines lead me to a stronger subject. I''m not quite sure what I should focus on.', '2008-02-27 06:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520486, 650522, 88204, '<td valign="top">I love the eyes! I wish there was a little more light on the eyes... maybe a reflector to bounce in some additoinal light to make the eyes pop a little more. Great pose by your model... tell him/her nice job!</td>', 'I love the eyes! I wish there was a little more light on the eyes... maybe a reflector to bounce in some additoinal light to make the eyes pop a little more. Great pose by your model... tell him/her nice job!', '2008-02-27 06:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520490, 651939, 88204, '<td valign="top">Wow! What a crazy and striking shot! I can''t wait to hear the story on this one. The repeating pictures are quite interesting. The background is very striking... again... eager to hear the technical details. So my question is... is it bad to read over people''s shoulders? I do it all the time on my daily bus ride and, while I don''t want to be obvious, I never thought it was that bad. Help me understand if I''m part of the problem! Great shot!</td>', 'Wow! What a crazy and striking shot! I can''t wait to hear the story on this one. The repeating pictures are quite interesting. The background is very striking... again... eager to hear the technical details. So my question is... is it bad to read over people''s shoulders? I do it all the time on my daily bus ride and, while I don''t want to be obvious, I never thought it was that bad. Help me understand if I''m part of the problem! Great shot!', '2008-02-27 06:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520491, 650880, 88204, '<td valign="top">Nice subject and composition. Tree seems not quite sharp and overall it feels underexposed. It needs a little more punch.</td>', 'Nice subject and composition. Tree seems not quite sharp and overall it feels underexposed. It needs a little more punch.', '2008-02-27 06:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520498, 651759, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great subject(s)! I love it that the players are white and black too. Lighting doesn''t quite do it for me... I start to lose the face of the person on the left in the background and there''s too much dark background visible.</td>', 'Great subject(s)! I love it that the players are white and black too. Lighting doesn''t quite do it for me... I start to lose the face of the person on the left in the background and there''s too much dark background visible.', '2008-02-27 06:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520500, 649660, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great focus, compostion and lighting. I love how soft and understated the light is.</td>', 'Great focus, compostion and lighting. I love how soft and understated the light is.', '2008-02-27 06:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520503, 650708, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great use of black and white. I think I''d like the lighthouse a little more off center... maybe in the upper left hand corner to simplify and also see the end of the land on the right.</td>', 'Great use of black and white. I think I''d like the lighthouse a little more off center... maybe in the upper left hand corner to simplify and also see the end of the land on the right.', '2008-02-27 06:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520505, 650367, 88204, '<td valign="top">Very black and white but a house doesn''t do much for me as a subject.</td>', 'Very black and white but a house doesn''t do much for me as a subject.', '2008-02-27 06:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520506, 651565, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I love the framing, the expression, the dark eyes and especially the grain. Looks like an old movie star shot. My favorite so far.</td>', 'Great shot. I love the framing, the expression, the dark eyes and especially the grain. Looks like an old movie star shot. My favorite so far.', '2008-02-27 06:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520541, 651783, 88613, '<td valign="top">I really like the picture but it looks like it was post processed to black and white? Otherwise a really nice capture and a good job framing!</td>', 'I really like the picture but it looks like it was post processed to black and white? Otherwise a really nice capture and a good job framing!', '2008-02-27 07:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
