(4520573, 650329, 12733, '<td valign="top">Where do you draw the line between a small spot of color and enough color so it doesn''t meet the challenge? This is a very cute picture, and I would put it on the meets challenge side of the line.</td>', 'Where do you draw the line between a small spot of color and enough color so it doesn''t meet the challenge? This is a very cute picture, and I would put it on the meets challenge side of the line.', '2008-02-27 07:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
