(4520607, 651177, 12733, '<td valign="top">Her lips may not be red, but they sure are pink. Skin is a lighter pink, not really white. Sorry, but IMHO this doesn''t meet the challenge.</td>', 'Her lips may not be red, but they sure are pink. Skin is a lighter pink, not really white. Sorry, but IMHO this doesn''t meet the challenge.', '2008-02-27 08:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
