(4520638, 651799, 80058, '<td valign="top">Very nice how you backlit the afro with talcon powder/flour? hehehehe It''s a great outtake on the challenge, although I don''t find the angle of the model too pleasing, wish he''s body was turned just a lil bit more towards the camera so I can see more of his left eye... that eyeball is very hidden? Just my thoughts no major penalties anyway lol 9</td>', 'Very nice how you backlit the afro with talcon powder/flour? hehehehe It''s a great outtake on the challenge, although I don''t find the angle of the model too pleasing, wish he''s body was turned just a lil bit more towards the camera so I can see more of his left eye... that eyeball is very hidden? Just my thoughts no major penalties anyway lol 9', '2008-02-27 08:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4520639, 650783, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a color picture. "Almost" meeting the challenge is not the same as meeting it. A small spot of color in a mostly black and white picture may be unavoidable, but this is mostly color.</td>', 'This is a color picture. "Almost" meeting the challenge is not the same as meeting it. A small spot of color in a mostly black and white picture may be unavoidable, but this is mostly color.', '2008-02-27 08:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
