(4522097, 651960, 88254, '<td valign="top">the coffee is brown...</td>', 'the coffee is brown...', '2008-02-27 13:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522098, 651182, 88254, '<td valign="top">Wow - great shot!  I aspire to this.</td>', 'Wow - great shot!  I aspire to this.', '2008-02-27 13:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522099, 652062, 88254, '<td valign="top">Wow - you channeled my wife...  :-)</td>', 'Wow - you channeled my wife...  :-)', '2008-02-27 13:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522102, 650353, 88254, '<td valign="top">this could have used some more dof, cool though!</td>', 'this could have used some more dof, cool though!', '2008-02-27 13:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522103, 650391, 88254, '<td valign="top">"There is no high score."</td>', '"There is no high score."', '2008-02-27 13:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522106, 651812, 88254, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot!</td>', 'Awesome shot!', '2008-02-27 13:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522110, 650574, 88254, '<td valign="top">too high key.</td>', 'too high key.', '2008-02-27 13:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522115, 650574, 3087, '<td valign="top">Blimey! That''s actually very interesting.</td>', 'Blimey! That''s actually very interesting.', '2008-02-27 13:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522116, 651734, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely detail.</td>', 'Lovely detail.', '2008-02-27 13:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522118, 651774, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely silhouette with strong composition and framing.</td>', 'Lovely silhouette with strong composition and framing.', '2008-02-27 13:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522120, 651162, 25155, '<td valign="top">Nice use of negative space!</td>', 'Nice use of negative space!', '2008-02-27 13:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522121, 650445, 3087, '<td valign="top">The touch of pink in the lips and the brown of the eyes emphasise the black and white hair and make-up.</td>', 'The touch of pink in the lips and the brown of the eyes emphasise the black and white hair and make-up.', '2008-02-27 13:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522123, 651701, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and your composition, with the white part of the background just behind the black beak and the darker background areas behind the white of the bird... that''s really great.</td>', 'Beautiful and your composition, with the white part of the background just behind the black beak and the darker background areas behind the white of the bird... that''s really great.', '2008-02-27 13:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522125, 651635, 3087, '<td valign="top">That''s fun and funky and has some really strong compositional features. Really like it.</td>', 'That''s fun and funky and has some really strong compositional features. Really like it.', '2008-02-27 13:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522127, 650082, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and that eye contact is striking.</td>', 'Nice composition and that eye contact is striking.', '2008-02-27 13:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522130, 651165, 3087, '<td valign="top">So surreal. I like it.</td>', 'So surreal. I like it.', '2008-02-27 13:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522132, 651919, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely close-up really allows me to focus on the curves and shapes and shadows whilst still clearly recognising the subject. Works well.</td>', 'Lovely close-up really allows me to focus on the curves and shapes and shadows whilst still clearly recognising the subject. Works well.', '2008-02-27 13:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522133, 651799, 3087, '<td valign="top">Cute and I like the unusual pose with the model looking back over the shoulder.</td>', 'Cute and I like the unusual pose with the model looking back over the shoulder.', '2008-02-27 13:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522134, 649804, 3087, '<td valign="top">Kind of disturbing, quirky, funky... I like it.</td>', 'Kind of disturbing, quirky, funky... I like it.', '2008-02-27 13:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522136, 651162, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2008-02-27 13:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522143, 651122, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow. Beautiful lighting, really nice. Cropping feels too tight to me.</td>', 'Wow. Beautiful lighting, really nice. Cropping feels too tight to me.', '2008-02-27 13:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522155, 651812, 3087, '<td valign="top">The way the boat is almost surrounded by the mist works really well. I love the way the orange buoy just emphasises the lack of colour elsewhere.</td>', 'The way the boat is almost surrounded by the mist works really well. I love the way the orange buoy just emphasises the lack of colour elsewhere.', '2008-02-27 13:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522156, 651711, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene. Like that lone walker.</td>', 'Beautiful scene. Like that lone walker.', '2008-02-27 13:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522160, 651090, 3087, '<td valign="top">Can be interpreted in a number of ways. Like how it is so open to finding meaning within it.</td>', 'Can be interpreted in a number of ways. Like how it is so open to finding meaning within it.', '2008-02-27 13:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522178, 651711, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image.  Perfect scene for this challenge and you''ve composed it quite well.  Nice!</td>', 'Wonderful image.  Perfect scene for this challenge and you''ve composed it quite well.  Nice!', '2008-02-27 13:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522187, 651962, 30049, '<td valign="top">Simple, yet very effective subject for this challenge.  Plenty of visual interest to hold the viewers attention.  I can almost hear the sound of the water going over the lip.  Well done!</td>', 'Simple, yet very effective subject for this challenge.  Plenty of visual interest to hold the viewers attention.  I can almost hear the sound of the water going over the lip.  Well done!', '2008-02-27 13:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522191, 650391, 86799, '<td valign="top">Interesting take.  I like it.</td>', 'Interesting take.  I like it.', '2008-02-27 13:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522194, 651090, 30049, '<td valign="top">I really like the simplicity of this.  Perfect scene for this challenge.  Just a hint of green in the moss embedded in the seams to confirm it''s a color shot.  Very nice.</td>', 'I really like the simplicity of this.  Perfect scene for this challenge.  Just a hint of green in the moss embedded in the seams to confirm it''s a color shot.  Very nice.', '2008-02-27 13:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522198, 651162, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great shot, great title...perfect for the challenge.  This is the kind of imagery that gets printed large for gallery display.  Very nice.</td>', 'Great shot, great title...perfect for the challenge.  This is the kind of imagery that gets printed large for gallery display.  Very nice.', '2008-02-27 13:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522202, 649739, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very well balanced scene here.  Looks like the focal point was dead centered on the roll of the waves coming/going ashore, which works well.  The gull in the upper reaches of this composition is just icing on the cake.  Well done!</td>', 'Very well balanced scene here.  Looks like the focal point was dead centered on the roll of the waves coming/going ashore, which works well.  The gull in the upper reaches of this composition is just icing on the cake.  Well done!', '2008-02-27 13:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522218, 649444, 30049, '<td valign="top">Kind of an interesting idea.  Get the feeling of this being extremely staged (not that it wouldn''t be...but selling it without the viewer thinking it is, is tricky).  The above comment aside, this would do much better if it was in focus.  Most of the image is quite soft.  If the upright glass &amp; stem were at least sharp the other items wouldn''t matter so much.</td>', 'Kind of an interesting idea.  Get the feeling of this being extremely staged (not that it wouldn''t be...but selling it without the viewer thinking it is, is tricky).  The above comment aside, this would do much better if it was in focus.  Most of the image is quite soft.  If the upright glass & stem were at least sharp the other items wouldn''t matter so much.', '2008-02-27 13:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522232, 650740, 5364, '<td valign="top">it looks rather washed out - lacking in contrast</td>', 'it looks rather washed out - lacking in contrast', '2008-02-27 13:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522233, 649857, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the isolated king, and usually a centered subject isn''t going to come across that well, but in this case by centering the king it seems stronger (matches your title well this way).  The image does feel a little underexposed.  A minor tweak with levels or a histogram adjustment would help some.  Last thing...the little details...clean the board before shooting (or do so in post-processing when allowed).  :-)<br/> <br/>All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the isolated king, and usually a centered subject isn''t going to come across that well, but in this case by centering the king it seems stronger (matches your title well this way).  The image does feel a little underexposed.  A minor tweak with levels or a histogram adjustment would help some.  Last thing...the little details...clean the board before shooting (or do so in post-processing when allowed).  :-) All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-02-27 13:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
