(4523514, 649895, 27556, '<td valign="top">this is black and brown in a black and white challenge. I like the texture in the sand, but the hot spots from the shells are very distracting, I dont find the pose of the shadow interisting either.</td>', 'this is black and brown in a black and white challenge. I like the texture in the sand, but the hot spots from the shells are very distracting, I dont find the pose of the shadow interisting either.', '2008-02-27 20:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
