(4523525, 650099, 27556, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, but  I am inturpreting the rules very literally for this challenge and the yellow eyes take away from the illusion that this would have been a black and white picture.</td>', 'I love this shot, but  I am inturpreting the rules very literally for this challenge and the yellow eyes take away from the illusion that this would have been a black and white picture.', '2008-02-27 20:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4523529, 649962, 27556, '<td valign="top">I likethis shot, but  I am inturpreting the rules very literally for this challenge and the yellow eyes take away from the illusion that this would have been a black and white picture. Also the black fur is too black I would like to be able to see details in the fur texture</td>', 'I likethis shot, but  I am inturpreting the rules very literally for this challenge and the yellow eyes take away from the illusion that this would have been a black and white picture. Also the black fur is too black I would like to be able to see details in the fur texture', '2008-02-27 20:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4523532, 651806, 90414, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a bit too closely cropped?</td>', 'Perhaps a bit too closely cropped?', '2008-02-27 20:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4523540, 649239, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice B/W presentation.  This scene works well for the challenge.  I know it''s a minor thing, and rarely one worth commenting on, but your choice of border gives the photo a nice break from the voting page without being overbearing.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice B/W presentation.  This scene works well for the challenge.  I know it''s a minor thing, and rarely one worth commenting on, but your choice of border gives the photo a nice break from the voting page without being overbearing. Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-02-27 20:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
