(4523542, 651172, 27556, '<td valign="top">Nice Job, an animal shot that actually looks like its black and white,</td>', 'Nice Job, an animal shot that actually looks like its black and white,', '2008-02-27 20:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4523543, 651605, 27556, '<td valign="top">focus needs to be tighter</td>', 'focus needs to be tighter', '2008-02-27 20:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4523552, 651159, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok, technically this is soft and overexposed in the highlights...but I really like it.  :-)  It''s natural, like how you''d see it in person.  Not sure how it would print, but in this format it presents well IMO.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Ok, technically this is soft and overexposed in the highlights...but I really like it.  :-)  It''s natural, like how you''d see it in person.  Not sure how it would print, but in this format it presents well IMO. Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-02-27 20:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4523554, 651978, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice little touch of color to add some warmth and character to this, yet still showing a B/W image overall for this challenge theme.  Clever, creative, and simple.  A combination to do well for sure!  :-)<br/> <br/>Good luck!</td>', 'Nice little touch of color to add some warmth and character to this, yet still showing a B/W image overall for this challenge theme.  Clever, creative, and simple.  A combination to do well for sure!  :-) Good luck!', '2008-02-27 20:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
