(4523574, 651923, 32872, '<td valign="top">Ha such a cute and appropriate title!  I like the glowing light and your choice of border.</td>', 'Ha such a cute and appropriate title!  I like the glowing light and your choice of border.', '2008-02-27 20:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4523575, 650596, 90414, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot, gorgeous lighting. Are you interpreting light and shadow as black and white?</td>', 'beautiful shot, gorgeous lighting. Are you interpreting light and shadow as black and white?', '2008-02-27 20:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4523588, 650645, 32872, '<td valign="top">Ahhh very nice composition and subject matter!  Nice lighting and detail, too. I wish it looked a tad more b/w, but still a great image.</td>', 'Ahhh very nice composition and subject matter!  Nice lighting and detail, too. I wish it looked a tad more b/w, but still a great image.', '2008-02-27 21:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4523592, 649562, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hi.  I really want to say something constructive here...  :-)<br/> <br/>I can understand the allure of using dominoes as the subject as they fit the B/W theme and can be easily positioned.<br/> <br/>What''s hurting this is the presentation is very static and there''s no sizzle in the POV.  The lighting is also quite harsh resulting in heavy shadows.  Maybe something from a lower angle, a longer background to work with, and some softer/reflected lighting?<br/> <br/>Just some thoughts...and JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Hi.  I really want to say something constructive here...  :-) I can understand the allure of using dominoes as the subject as they fit the B/W theme and can be easily positioned. What''s hurting this is the presentation is very static and there''s no sizzle in the POV.  The lighting is also quite harsh resulting in heavy shadows.  Maybe something from a lower angle, a longer background to work with, and some softer/reflected lighting? Just some thoughts...and JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-02-27 21:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4523595, 651631, 32872, '<td valign="top">Sweet!  This is perfect for the challenge. Well-executed, this would make a beautiful ad. I like your interesting editing...wish this were a bit sharper, but still a nice image!</td>', 'Sweet!  This is perfect for the challenge. Well-executed, this would make a beautiful ad. I like your interesting editing...wish this were a bit sharper, but still a nice image!', '2008-02-27 21:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4523597, 650596, 32872, '<td valign="top">Oh my this is anything but black and white!  Maybe you misunderstood the challenge..so sorry because this is such a pretty scene!</td>', 'Oh my this is anything but black and white!  Maybe you misunderstood the challenge..so sorry because this is such a pretty scene!', '2008-02-27 21:06:04.000000', NULL, 1);
