(4523648, 650596, 86799, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, but DNMC I think?  Lovely anyway!  Montana, N Dakota, maybe Alberta?</td>', 'Beautiful, but DNMC I think?  Lovely anyway!  Montana, N Dakota, maybe Alberta?', '2008-02-27 21:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4523649, 651092, 88204, '<td valign="top">Love the shot and concept. Makeup looks a little uneven on the forehead which distracts a bit. Still very nice.</td>', 'Love the shot and concept. Makeup looks a little uneven on the forehead which distracts a bit. Still very nice.', '2008-02-27 21:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4523650, 650431, 88204, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot for this challenge. I love the definition in the eye. Your model did a great job of posing for you. Pet shots can get tiring but this one is great.</td>', 'Beautiful shot for this challenge. I love the definition in the eye. Your model did a great job of posing for you. Pet shots can get tiring but this one is great.', '2008-02-27 21:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4523651, 652050, 86799, '<td valign="top">Cool.  nice idea, well done.</td>', 'Cool.  nice idea, well done.', '2008-02-27 21:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4523652, 651613, 80807, '<td valign="top">I would have scored it higher without the color, even though overall it''s a pretty nice effect.</td>', 'I would have scored it higher without the color, even though overall it''s a pretty nice effect.', '2008-02-27 21:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4523654, 651426, 88204, '<td valign="top">Spooky head. Great smoke and lighting. Seems like it should be a rock start instead of the strange head thing... I''m not sure I get the mask.</td>', 'Spooky head. Great smoke and lighting. Seems like it should be a rock start instead of the strange head thing... I''m not sure I get the mask.', '2008-02-27 21:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4523659, 651645, 88204, '<td valign="top">Seems very ordinary. Bulbs aren''t quite in focus. Glass looks dirty. Nothing really catches my eye.</td>', 'Seems very ordinary. Bulbs aren''t quite in focus. Glass looks dirty. Nothing really catches my eye.', '2008-02-27 21:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4523660, 650122, 28261, '<td valign="top">Too much color for the B/W part of this challenge. Subject does not consist of a large enough portion of the image to be considered the actual subject despite the title.  Great image, technically fine, IMO: Not in the spirit of the challenge.  Nominate for OOBIE.</td>', 'Too much color for the B/W part of this challenge. Subject does not consist of a large enough portion of the image to be considered the actual subject despite the title.  Great image, technically fine, IMO: Not in the spirit of the challenge.  Nominate for OOBIE.', '2008-02-27 21:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4523666, 651596, 80807, '<td valign="top">Not having had much luck with spiders and spiderwebs myself, I can really appreciate this shot.  9</td>', 'Not having had much luck with spiders and spiderwebs myself, I can really appreciate this shot.  9', '2008-02-27 21:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4523675, 650596, 28261, '<td valign="top">...dnmc = 1, but I''m certain you already know that.  Otherwise a 10 for a beautiful image, excellent play of light and shadow and use of DOF/POV.<br/> <br/>IMO: Too much color for the B/W spirit of this challenge. Subject (monochromatic cows) does not consist of a large enough portion of the image to be considered the actual subject despite the title.  Qualifies for an OOBIE tho.</td>', '...dnmc = 1, but I''m certain you already know that.  Otherwise a 10 for a beautiful image, excellent play of light and shadow and use of DOF/POV. IMO: Too much color for the B/W spirit of this challenge. Subject (monochromatic cows) does not consist of a large enough portion of the image to be considered the actual subject despite the title.  Qualifies for an OOBIE tho.', '2008-02-27 21:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4523679, 651937, 88204, '<td valign="top">Wow... that''s just plain creepy! I hope you didn''t have to shoot someone to get the smoke!  :)<br/> <br/>Great shot. I love how you just lit the barrel... leaves me wondering about the rest of the gun. The smoke looks great. I tried smoke and had a tough time with it... yours looks great. Well done.</td>', 'Wow... that''s just plain creepy! I hope you didn''t have to shoot someone to get the smoke!  :) Great shot. I love how you just lit the barrel... leaves me wondering about the rest of the gun. The smoke looks great. I tried smoke and had a tough time with it... yours looks great. Well done.', '2008-02-27 21:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4523687, 650779, 88204, '<td valign="top">You captured a great moment with the wings and open beak. I wouldn''t expect this bird on the snow, I''d expect it on the beach, so that makes it even more interesting. Great focus and DoF. I''m not a fan of humorous titles... it makes it seem like you don''t have confidence in your shot.</td>', 'You captured a great moment with the wings and open beak. I wouldn''t expect this bird on the snow, I''d expect it on the beach, so that makes it even more interesting. Great focus and DoF. I''m not a fan of humorous titles... it makes it seem like you don''t have confidence in your shot.', '2008-02-27 21:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4523698, 651710, 88204, '<td valign="top">Very moody. The people on the right make the shot for me. I''d prefer no headlights so I could focus solely on the people. The pole in front is a tad too strong for me... might be good to dodge it a bit to demphasize.</td>', 'Very moody. The people on the right make the shot for me. I''d prefer no headlights so I could focus solely on the people. The pole in front is a tad too strong for me... might be good to dodge it a bit to demphasize.', '2008-02-27 21:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
