(4525314, 651701, 27556, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see some more details in the feathers here. and the lighting seems a bit flat, perhapse it could have been spruced up a tad in post. However I feel the composition is working very nicely for this shot.</td>', 'I would have liked to see some more details in the feathers here. and the lighting seems a bit flat, perhapse it could have been spruced up a tad in post. However I feel the composition is working very nicely for this shot.', '2008-02-28 13:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4525320, 649444, 27556, '<td valign="top">great idea, forcus needs work. A shot like this needs to be sharp as a tack all around. I would also like to see a stronger distinction between the glass and the background on the left side and the top of the glass. It seems to be melting into the background and not poping off of it.</td>', 'great idea, forcus needs work. A shot like this needs to be sharp as a tack all around. I would also like to see a stronger distinction between the glass and the background on the left side and the top of the glass. It seems to be melting into the background and not poping off of it.', '2008-02-28 13:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4525325, 651914, 27556, '<td valign="top">I like the circular pattern that is being created by the reflection. I feel the crop is a bit too tight on the top I would have liked to see a little more of the bridge.</td>', 'I like the circular pattern that is being created by the reflection. I feel the crop is a bit too tight on the top I would have liked to see a little more of the bridge.', '2008-02-28 13:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4525329, 651162, 27556, '<td valign="top">the title has it... very simple shot, yet very clean and leaves you thinking and wondering what was going on here, what is the story to these 3 little trees. On the tech side I am seeing noise in the white and pixelization on the trees, this might have been cropped in to much for the resolution camera you were using.</td>', 'the title has it... very simple shot, yet very clean and leaves you thinking and wondering what was going on here, what is the story to these 3 little trees. On the tech side I am seeing noise in the white and pixelization on the trees, this might have been cropped in to much for the resolution camera you were using.', '2008-02-28 13:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4525334, 652059, 27556, '<td valign="top">nice composition, I enjoy the reflection in the board. Interesting choice to use space as a backdrop, it sets your shot apart from other chess board shots I have seen.</td>', 'nice composition, I enjoy the reflection in the board. Interesting choice to use space as a backdrop, it sets your shot apart from other chess board shots I have seen.', '2008-02-28 13:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
