(4525727, 649895, 5364, '<td valign="top">I don''t think you have made the most of your subjects here and strangely that fact that your shadow shows that you had your hand in your pocket giving the impression of a casual snapshot doesn''t help me feel positive towards this.<br/>If you had got close to the shells with the ripples in the sand I think you would have a more interesting picture.</td>', 'I don''t think you have made the most of your subjects here and strangely that fact that your shadow shows that you had your hand in your pocket giving the impression of a casual snapshot doesn''t help me feel positive towards this.If you had got close to the shells with the ripples in the sand I think you would have a more interesting picture.', '2008-02-28 16:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4525730, 649733, 90658, '<td valign="top">The lighting was not your friend on this one.</td>', 'The lighting was not your friend on this one.', '2008-02-28 16:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4525745, 651919, 90658, '<td valign="top">My first thought when I saw this one was WOW!!!!! Then I started noticing little things that were slightly off.  Everything about this shot screams graphic, sharp relief, stark edges, very defined images.  Then I see softening in the handle some blurring of the plate.  Just enough to be noticed, but so much it made me wonder if that was your intent.  If this was just oof, that''s too bad because you had this one nailed.  If it was intentional it didn''t go far enough.</td>', 'My first thought when I saw this one was WOW!!!!! Then I started noticing little things that were slightly off.  Everything about this shot screams graphic, sharp relief, stark edges, very defined images.  Then I see softening in the handle some blurring of the plate.  Just enough to be noticed, but so much it made me wonder if that was your intent.  If this was just oof, that''s too bad because you had this one nailed.  If it was intentional it didn''t go far enough.', '2008-02-28 16:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4525746, 651812, 5364, '<td valign="top">This has some potential to be really good, but I think you may have over processed the fog a bit</td>', 'This has some potential to be really good, but I think you may have over processed the fog a bit', '2008-02-28 16:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
