(4526922, 650123, 54645, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. I love images of trees. It would be better in B &amp; W ;) 6</td>', 'Fantastic. I love images of trees. It would be better in B & W ;) 6', '2008-02-29 03:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4526927, 651920, 54645, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites. Needs a bit more contrast in my opinion, but seems that would be a tall order given the colors in this image. 7</td>', 'One of my favorites. Needs a bit more contrast in my opinion, but seems that would be a tall order given the colors in this image. 7', '2008-02-29 03:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4526928, 649922, 54645, '<td valign="top">great</td>', 'great', '2008-02-29 03:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527024, 651912, 89341, '<td valign="top">I like the pattern but there''s something about the image that I''m just not on board with ... I''m not quite sure what it is either, focus is good and sharpness is good, I think the fact the sky is washed out doesn''t help ... maybe a different angle shooting up at the building would make the photo stand out more by giving an interesting perspective</td>', 'I like the pattern but there''s something about the image that I''m just not on board with ... I''m not quite sure what it is either, focus is good and sharpness is good, I think the fact the sky is washed out doesn''t help ... maybe a different angle shooting up at the building would make the photo stand out more by giving an interesting perspective', '2008-02-29 04:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527026, 651374, 89341, '<td valign="top">I see what you have done, a black and white picture in amongst colour pictures, clever .... but I find it a bit too cluttered, my eyes are jumping all over the image trying to find what I am supposed to be looking at ... I think the note on the left is a bit distracting and grabs my attention more than the other photos</td>', 'I see what you have done, a black and white picture in amongst colour pictures, clever .... but I find it a bit too cluttered, my eyes are jumping all over the image trying to find what I am supposed to be looking at ... I think the note on the left is a bit distracting and grabs my attention more than the other photos', '2008-02-29 04:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527035, 649899, 89341, '<td valign="top">The focus is good and the DOF is good but I don''t find the picture stands out enough ... maybe if the base could have had more of a reflection (not really possible I guess) or the top didn''t look a little grubby</td>', 'The focus is good and the DOF is good but I don''t find the picture stands out enough ... maybe if the base could have had more of a reflection (not really possible I guess) or the top didn''t look a little grubby', '2008-02-29 04:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527039, 651551, 89341, '<td valign="top">Sorry but this doesn''t quite work for me, it seems a little out of focus or maybe just the light reflection bugs me a little</td>', 'Sorry but this doesn''t quite work for me, it seems a little out of focus or maybe just the light reflection bugs me a little', '2008-02-29 04:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527047, 649180, 89341, '<td valign="top">Nice focus on the eye and good reflection but the rest of the image just seems to "messy" to me, it''s not quite in focus and not quite out of focus enough ... maybe a larger aperture would have helped to blur the background and isolate the eye more</td>', 'Nice focus on the eye and good reflection but the rest of the image just seems to "messy" to me, it''s not quite in focus and not quite out of focus enough ... maybe a larger aperture would have helped to blur the background and isolate the eye more', '2008-02-29 04:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527055, 651808, 89341, '<td valign="top">I like the angle you have chosen however the image doesn''t really stand out to me ... I find the twig at the top a little odd, I guess it''s meant to be there .... may have worked better if the words had stood out more though the fact the stone is nearly 200 years old would make that hard to correct! Maybe a flash would have cast a shadow to make the words stand out</td>', 'I like the angle you have chosen however the image doesn''t really stand out to me ... I find the twig at the top a little odd, I guess it''s meant to be there .... may have worked better if the words had stood out more though the fact the stone is nearly 200 years old would make that hard to correct! Maybe a flash would have cast a shadow to make the words stand out', '2008-02-29 05:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527058, 651933, 89341, '<td valign="top">The sharpness, DOF and reflection are all fantastic, the colours(!) are all very prominent and really stand out well, I''m going to have to come back and find out what you used for the base.</td>', 'The sharpness, DOF and reflection are all fantastic, the colours(!) are all very prominent and really stand out well, I''m going to have to come back and find out what you used for the base.', '2008-02-29 05:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527062, 650582, 89341, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and the subject however I''m not crazy about the background choice and think the milk is just out of focus a tiny amount ... that said I still think this is a good picture and will do well</td>', 'I really like the composition and the subject however I''m not crazy about the background choice and think the milk is just out of focus a tiny amount ... that said I still think this is a good picture and will do well', '2008-02-29 05:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527069, 649979, 89341, '<td valign="top">I like the choice of background, something about the focus and/or reflection on the glass bothers me a little though</td>', 'I like the choice of background, something about the focus and/or reflection on the glass bothers me a little though', '2008-02-29 05:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527098, 651711, 86799, '<td valign="top">Best of the challenge, IMO.  Great depth.  Leading lines.  Huge scale of grays.  and black.  and white.  Top notch.</td>', 'Best of the challenge, IMO.  Great depth.  Leading lines.  Huge scale of grays.  and black.  and white.  Top notch.', '2008-02-29 05:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527099, 651962, 86799, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Love the abstract &amp; metallic effect.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Love the abstract & metallic effect.', '2008-02-29 05:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527104, 650353, 86799, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  Great title.  Very good quality, comp.</td>', 'Excellent!  Great title.  Very good quality, comp.', '2008-02-29 05:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527106, 649666, 86799, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2008-02-29 05:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527111, 650507, 86799, '<td valign="top">Cool.  Nice lighting, even deep in the stack.  Good work.</td>', 'Cool.  Nice lighting, even deep in the stack.  Good work.', '2008-02-29 05:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527113, 651561, 86799, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.  Nice catch.</td>', 'Wonderful.  Nice catch.', '2008-02-29 05:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527115, 652027, 86799, '<td valign="top">Great range, very gentle.</td>', 'Great range, very gentle.', '2008-02-29 05:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527121, 651920, 86799, '<td valign="top">Terrific range of grays.  Nice grab.  Nice title.  Almost looks like casual conversation:  Hi, Bob.  Yo, Phil, what''s up?  Seen fish?</td>', 'Terrific range of grays.  Nice grab.  Nice title.  Almost looks like casual conversation:  Hi, Bob.  Yo, Phil, what''s up?  Seen fish?', '2008-02-29 05:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527127, 651096, 86799, '<td valign="top">Yeah, baby!  Oh...and...nice pic, too.  Nice comp and quality.</td>', 'Yeah, baby!  Oh...and...nice pic, too.  Nice comp and quality.', '2008-02-29 05:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527135, 650783, 86799, '<td valign="top">Perfect example of the debate over "color".  After all the noise and BS there is still a great photograph to enjoy.  The B&amp;W flavor is prevalent without being exclusive.  The color is necessary.  Nice job.</td>', 'Perfect example of the debate over "color".  After all the noise and BS there is still a great photograph to enjoy.  The B&W flavor is prevalent without being exclusive.  The color is necessary.  Nice job.', '2008-02-29 05:55:47.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4527140, 651404, 86799, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective.  Stark, but invites me to come put another set of footprints on the pristine snow.  Very cool shot.  Minor negative is the small piece of the next tree on the right that maybe could have been excluded.  Very minor.  Does not detract from the overall flavor.</td>', 'Simple and effective.  Stark, but invites me to come put another set of footprints on the pristine snow.  Very cool shot.  Minor negative is the small piece of the next tree on the right that maybe could have been excluded.  Very minor.  Does not detract from the overall flavor.', '2008-02-29 05:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527153, 650596, 83686, '<td valign="top">looking for the brown here? read the challenge discription(I stand corrected, you did read the description right and I did not)<br/> <br/>That being said, the subject of this photo is not something that is black, white or greyscale which means it still does not meet the criteria of the challenge. The subject of this, according to your title, is a action which is not clearly depicted by your submission. However, if the cows had been the focus of your photo and I had read the challenge correctly I would have score this higher. Your photo is a good landscape and I do like the colors but I think it would have done better in a different challenge.</td>', 'looking for the brown here? read the challenge discription(I stand corrected, you did read the description right and I did not) That being said, the subject of this photo is not something that is black, white or greyscale which means it still does not meet the criteria of the challenge. The subject of this, according to your title, is a action which is not clearly depicted by your submission. However, if the cows had been the focus of your photo and I had read the challenge correctly I would have score this higher. Your photo is a good landscape and I do like the colors but I think it would have done better in a different challenge.', '2008-02-29 06:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527262, 650596, 88523, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo, but a bit off challenge topic?</td>', 'Very nice photo, but a bit off challenge topic?', '2008-02-29 07:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527265, 650482, 88523, '<td valign="top">cool design! If the bird were in focus It would be great! (imo)</td>', 'cool design! If the bird were in focus It would be great! (imo)', '2008-02-29 07:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527301, 649928, 27556, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great effort, but there is a grainy look that is not working for me. I dont know if it was caused by being in motion, the snow that was falling or otherwise.</td>', 'I think this is a great effort, but there is a grainy look that is not working for me. I dont know if it was caused by being in motion, the snow that was falling or otherwise.', '2008-02-29 08:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527302, 650892, 27556, '<td valign="top">There is a good deal of digital noise in the water especially where the sun is reflecting. the composition is beautiful though.</td>', 'There is a good deal of digital noise in the water especially where the sun is reflecting. the composition is beautiful though.', '2008-02-29 08:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527305, 651110, 27556, '<td valign="top">This is a great attempt, I can see detail in the wings, but it would be nice to see even more details. The lighting also is flat. Perhapes better lighting would help with the details as well.</td>', 'This is a great attempt, I can see detail in the wings, but it would be nice to see even more details. The lighting also is flat. Perhapes better lighting would help with the details as well.', '2008-02-29 08:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527306, 650046, 27556, '<td valign="top">thats a lot of blue sky for a black and white challenge. The focus is too soft and there is a good deal of noise in the back ground</td>', 'thats a lot of blue sky for a black and white challenge. The focus is too soft and there is a good deal of noise in the back ground', '2008-02-29 08:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527308, 650007, 27556, '<td valign="top">The subject is not interesting to me. I do feel that this was a well composed shot however I feel the lighting needed work. The upper most tape is well lit but the other 2 seem flat.</td>', 'The subject is not interesting to me. I do feel that this was a well composed shot however I feel the lighting needed work. The upper most tape is well lit but the other 2 seem flat.', '2008-02-29 08:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527311, 651760, 27556, '<td valign="top">Cute critter, however the composition could use some work. Perhapse using the rule of thirds would make this more interesting</td>', 'Cute critter, however the composition could use some work. Perhapse using the rule of thirds would make this more interesting', '2008-02-29 08:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527313, 650740, 27556, '<td valign="top">I like I tight this shot is, but on that same token if we are this close we need to be in focus.</td>', 'I like I tight this shot is, but on that same token if we are this close we need to be in focus.', '2008-02-29 08:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527316, 651930, 27556, '<td valign="top">I understand you were trying to achieve a darker look but there is too much grain in the dark areas. It looks like the shot was exposed for the pipes with the light in them.</td>', 'I understand you were trying to achieve a darker look but there is too much grain in the dark areas. It looks like the shot was exposed for the pipes with the light in them.', '2008-02-29 08:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527317, 651551, 27556, '<td valign="top">I am not a fan of the post processing.</td>', 'I am not a fan of the post processing.', '2008-02-29 08:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527319, 649564, 27556, '<td valign="top">Creative idea kudos for that. If the lighting on this shot was better it would be more impactful. Definatly worth revisiting.</td>', 'Creative idea kudos for that. If the lighting on this shot was better it would be more impactful. Definatly worth revisiting.', '2008-02-29 08:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527320, 650350, 27556, '<td valign="top">I likei the composition. The grain in this shot is overwhelping. Try a different ISO next time.</td>', 'I likei the composition. The grain in this shot is overwhelping. Try a different ISO next time.', '2008-02-29 08:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527321, 651141, 27556, '<td valign="top">this is uninteresting and poorly lit</td>', 'this is uninteresting and poorly lit', '2008-02-29 08:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527323, 651177, 27556, '<td valign="top">Although this does remind me of a rock band / paparatzi type shot, i dont feel it is workign for me. I would rather have her fully in frame, or maybe her eye looking up and glaring. Just something to give it a little extra spark.</td>', 'Although this does remind me of a rock band / paparatzi type shot, i dont feel it is workign for me. I would rather have her fully in frame, or maybe her eye looking up and glaring. Just something to give it a little extra spark.', '2008-02-29 08:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527325, 651128, 27556, '<td valign="top">On a shot like this the focus needs to be sharp as a tack. and the lighting needs to be spot on.</td>', 'On a shot like this the focus needs to be sharp as a tack. and the lighting needs to be spot on.', '2008-02-29 08:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527327, 652020, 27556, '<td valign="top">The angle on this is slightly to steep for my taste. But i do like how tight this shot is and how it takes up the whole frame.</td>', 'The angle on this is slightly to steep for my taste. But i do like how tight this shot is and how it takes up the whole frame.', '2008-02-29 08:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527329, 650645, 27556, '<td valign="top">nice angle. If the fence was black it would have fit the challenge a bit better.</td>', 'nice angle. If the fence was black it would have fit the challenge a bit better.', '2008-02-29 08:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527330, 651659, 27556, '<td valign="top">the focus is too soft, and there is too much grain. try a different ISO setting next time to avoid that.</td>', 'the focus is too soft, and there is too much grain. try a different ISO setting next time to avoid that.', '2008-02-29 08:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527333, 650482, 27556, '<td valign="top">Niuce idea. but the bird is too far away. However those branches are very interesting. I wonder, you could probabally get a great texture shot just from shooting them.</td>', 'Niuce idea. but the bird is too far away. However those branches are very interesting. I wonder, you could probabally get a great texture shot just from shooting them.', '2008-02-29 08:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527334, 652041, 27556, '<td valign="top">what a cutie. But this was a black and white challenge, I dont see any white in this shot. composition wise I do like this angle, and the placement of the dog in the frame.</td>', 'what a cutie. But this was a black and white challenge, I dont see any white in this shot. composition wise I do like this angle, and the placement of the dog in the frame.', '2008-02-29 08:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527338, 652070, 27556, '<td valign="top">Im not sure what to look at. My eye is following the cement wall then getting lost in the tangle of trees. there is just too much going on the left side of this shot</td>', 'Im not sure what to look at. My eye is following the cement wall then getting lost in the tangle of trees. there is just too much going on the left side of this shot', '2008-02-29 08:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527342, 651759, 27556, '<td valign="top">I was viewing this challenge as a b&amp;w recreation... that asider I feel the lighting is flat on this shot. and there is too much in the background. It would have deon the picture more justice if they were against a wall playing. something more solid</td>', 'I was viewing this challenge as a b&w recreation... that asider I feel the lighting is flat on this shot. and there is too much in the background. It would have deon the picture more justice if they were against a wall playing. something more solid', '2008-02-29 08:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527344, 651765, 27556, '<td valign="top">I do appreciate the humor to this shot, but there needs to be more of a light on the animal IMHO</td>', 'I do appreciate the humor to this shot, but there needs to be more of a light on the animal IMHO', '2008-02-29 08:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527347, 650122, 27556, '<td valign="top">I dont feel this meets the challenge, I was looking for b&amp;w recreations, or even inturpreting this as the subject is b&amp;w yours is not. The subjects hair is, but the man is the actual subject.</td>', 'I dont feel this meets the challenge, I was looking for b&w recreations, or even inturpreting this as the subject is b&w yours is not. The subjects hair is, but the man is the actual subject.', '2008-02-29 08:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527348, 650783, 27556, '<td valign="top">the soft focus on this shot is not working for me.</td>', 'the soft focus on this shot is not working for me.', '2008-02-29 08:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527350, 650596, 27556, '<td valign="top">I dont see how this picture fall within the challenge guidelines</td>', 'I dont see how this picture fall within the challenge guidelines', '2008-02-29 08:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527353, 650020, 27556, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the cat needs to be in sharper focus.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the cat needs to be in sharper focus.', '2008-02-29 08:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527355, 651808, 27556, '<td valign="top">interesting idea, but I dont know if its the focus or if the stone is weathered, but the text on the stone is very soft.</td>', 'interesting idea, but I dont know if its the focus or if the stone is weathered, but the text on the stone is very soft.', '2008-02-29 08:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527379, 651734, 84520, '<td valign="top">A nice picture, of a feather, with a slight reflection underneath.  This must be Irene.  It isn''t quite as sharp as I would like, but that''s probably because it''s a fuzzy feather. <br/> <br/>Schlicht und einfach, indeed :)</td>', 'A nice picture, of a feather, with a slight reflection underneath.  This must be Irene.  It isn''t quite as sharp as I would like, but that''s probably because it''s a fuzzy feather.  Schlicht und einfach, indeed :)', '2008-02-29 08:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527380, 649402, 84520, '<td valign="top">I wish the image, from the woman''s neck down, was in focus.</td>', 'I wish the image, from the woman''s neck down, was in focus.', '2008-02-29 08:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527395, 650244, 84520, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but I wish the moon was in focus.  Try shooting with a 50mm prime focus lens...with the focus on infinity, you''ll get a crisp tree line and a crisp moon.</td>', 'Nice composition, but I wish the moon was in focus.  Try shooting with a 50mm prime focus lens...with the focus on infinity, you''ll get a crisp tree line and a crisp moon.', '2008-02-29 09:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527442, 649884, 46295, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective of this shot</td>', 'I like the perspective of this shot', '2008-02-29 09:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527446, 650733, 46295, '<td valign="top">very interesting....</td>', 'very interesting....', '2008-02-29 09:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527450, 651758, 46295, '<td valign="top">creative and great use of light</td>', 'creative and great use of light', '2008-02-29 09:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527453, 651811, 46295, '<td valign="top">very cool...</td>', 'very cool...', '2008-02-29 09:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527457, 651809, 46295, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection of the music on the instrument...</td>', 'I like the reflection of the music on the instrument...', '2008-02-29 09:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527461, 651419, 40126, '<td valign="top">ribbon!</td>', 'ribbon!', '2008-02-29 09:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527486, 650733, 19841, '<td valign="top">I can see what you were trying to do, but the whole thing is blurry... except for a little bit that looks like a scratch.</td>', 'I can see what you were trying to do, but the whole thing is blurry... except for a little bit that looks like a scratch.', '2008-02-29 09:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527493, 650123, 19841, '<td valign="top">I understood the challenge to be to take a picture with no color in it.  The sky is blue.  Nice shot, though.</td>', 'I understood the challenge to be to take a picture with no color in it.  The sky is blue.  Nice shot, though.', '2008-02-29 09:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527500, 651565, 19841, '<td valign="top">Dramatic image!</td>', 'Dramatic image!', '2008-02-29 09:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527511, 651659, 19841, '<td valign="top">A sunset is not a "black and white" item.</td>', 'A sunset is not a "black and white" item.', '2008-02-29 09:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527528, 649895, 19841, '<td valign="top">Aside from the color in this "black and white" challenge, it''s hard to tell what''s going on in this picture.  The white specks may be shiny things in the sand, but they came out looking like flaws in the image.<br/> <br/>It''s difficult to get sparkly things to look right, but keep trying!</td>', 'Aside from the color in this "black and white" challenge, it''s hard to tell what''s going on in this picture.  The white specks may be shiny things in the sand, but they came out looking like flaws in the image. It''s difficult to get sparkly things to look right, but keep trying!', '2008-02-29 09:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527537, 650391, 19841, '<td valign="top">Interesting interpretation!</td>', 'Interesting interpretation!', '2008-02-29 09:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527551, 649180, 19841, '<td valign="top">It''s all sort of vague and blurry.  I can''t tell what kind of animal this is, and would like to see the texture on the fur.  Nice focus on the eye, though.</td>', 'It''s all sort of vague and blurry.  I can''t tell what kind of animal this is, and would like to see the texture on the fur.  Nice focus on the eye, though.', '2008-02-29 09:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527592, 651736, 19841, '<td valign="top">Awww... where''s the love for the licorice?  Nice concept!</td>', 'Awww... where''s the love for the licorice?  Nice concept!', '2008-02-29 09:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527644, 651382, 27556, '<td valign="top">simple clean and eligant.</td>', 'simple clean and eligant.', '2008-02-29 10:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527647, 652027, 27556, '<td valign="top">I love the texture and earthyness of this, the steam vapors comming from the cup make this shot come alive for me.</td>', 'I love the texture and earthyness of this, the steam vapors comming from the cup make this shot come alive for me.', '2008-02-29 10:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
