(4527799, 650431, 73981, '<td valign="top">One of very few pet shots I like. I''m not a pet shot person because I don''t think many have the talent to get there kind of pets in the right kind of composition...you did a wonderful job, and so did the model. 9</td>', 'One of very few pet shots I like. I''m not a pet shot person because I don''t think many have the talent to get there kind of pets in the right kind of composition...you did a wonderful job, and so did the model. 9', '2008-02-29 11:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
