(4527814, 651608, 73981, '<td valign="top">Gave you an 7. The makeup around the face isn''t as clean as it could be, which is what is keeping it from getting a 9. I docked 2 points for that...a bit harsh perhaps.</td>', 'Gave you an 7. The makeup around the face isn''t as clean as it could be, which is what is keeping it from getting a 9. I docked 2 points for that...a bit harsh perhaps.', '2008-02-29 11:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
