(4529104, 651397, 88054, '<td valign="top">I see the concept...Would have been better for me if there was not so much color (Perhaps a black or white background). IMO A close crop on the eyes or even the nose would have been better for this challenge. Nice composition.</td>', 'I see the concept...Would have been better for me if there was not so much color (Perhaps a black or white background). IMO A close crop on the eyes or even the nose would have been better for this challenge. Nice composition.', '2008-03-01 00:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529105, 650765, 88054, '<td valign="top">Great idea. A bit too blurry for me.</td>', 'Great idea. A bit too blurry for me.', '2008-03-01 00:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529115, 651960, 88054, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting. I always struggle with the lighting. Great composition.</td>', 'I like the lighting. I always struggle with the lighting. Great composition.', '2008-03-01 00:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529133, 649302, 88054, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. Wish I had a big glass of milk. The crumbs add a nice touch.</td>', 'I love this shot. Wish I had a big glass of milk. The crumbs add a nice touch.', '2008-03-01 00:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529139, 650783, 88054, '<td valign="top">Maybe not black and white but she is still beautiful. Great portrait.</td>', 'Maybe not black and white but she is still beautiful. Great portrait.', '2008-03-01 00:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529143, 651701, 88054, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2008-03-01 00:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529183, 650596, 88054, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo but not black and white. O.K. maybe the cows...and the shadows...and the clouds are indeed white but the sky is definitely blue! And the hills...they look green to me. There is some tan in there too. I am afraid this does not even come close to black and white for me. But I still love the photo.</td>', 'Beautiful photo but not black and white. O.K. maybe the cows...and the shadows...and the clouds are indeed white but the sky is definitely blue! And the hills...they look green to me. There is some tan in there too. I am afraid this does not even come close to black and white for me. But I still love the photo.', '2008-03-01 00:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529202, 651973, 88825, '<td valign="top">I love how you can just see the word oreo... nice composition!</td>', 'I love how you can just see the word oreo... nice composition!', '2008-03-01 00:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529627, 651613, 12733, '<td valign="top">If I didn''t read the title, I''d never know this had anything to do with "black and white in color." A small spot of color can get by, but the color is what makes this photo.</td>', 'If I didn''t read the title, I''d never know this had anything to do with "black and white in color." A small spot of color can get by, but the color is what makes this photo.', '2008-03-01 06:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529628, 651828, 12733, '<td valign="top">great lighting, nice pieces.</td>', 'great lighting, nice pieces.', '2008-03-01 06:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529629, 651083, 12733, '<td valign="top">With a closer crop, to get rid of some of the greenery, I could see this meeting the challenge. Sorry, it;s a great picture, but it loses points because of all the color.</td>', 'With a closer crop, to get rid of some of the greenery, I could see this meeting the challenge. Sorry, it;s a great picture, but it loses points because of all the color.', '2008-03-01 06:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529630, 651116, 12733, '<td valign="top">That small spot of color emphasizes the black and white around it. Very nice.</td>', 'That small spot of color emphasizes the black and white around it. Very nice.', '2008-03-01 06:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529631, 651162, 12733, '<td valign="top">Brilliant take on the challenge.</td>', 'Brilliant take on the challenge.', '2008-03-01 06:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529664, 649962, 71121, '<td valign="top">Could have been so good, but the eyes are not sharp :(</td>', 'Could have been so good, but the eyes are not sharp :(', '2008-03-01 07:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529803, 651807, 48697, '<td valign="top">Nice smooth background.</td>', 'Nice smooth background.', '2008-03-01 08:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529808, 651759, 48697, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea of this shot. Very clever with the use of black and white on the chess board and with the players. i do feel the lighting seems to be a bit harsh, though this could have been an impromtu shot and you might not have been able to set up a better lighting situation.</td>', 'I really like the idea of this shot. Very clever with the use of black and white on the chess board and with the players. i do feel the lighting seems to be a bit harsh, though this could have been an impromtu shot and you might not have been able to set up a better lighting situation.', '2008-03-01 08:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529810, 652021, 48697, '<td valign="top">cute puppie</td>', 'cute puppie', '2008-03-01 08:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529818, 652050, 48697, '<td valign="top">This is  a really cool abstract, i love this shot. The lighitng is dead on and a very nice DOF. I''m not sure what it is but I imagine it to be a group of iron particles that clump together when a magnet is use around them. Nice job and good luck.</td>', 'This is  a really cool abstract, i love this shot. The lighitng is dead on and a very nice DOF. I''m not sure what it is but I imagine it to be a group of iron particles that clump together when a magnet is use around them. Nice job and good luck.', '2008-03-01 09:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529826, 651128, 48697, '<td valign="top">I like the use of shadow and compositon in this shot but the lighting seesm a bit off. I feel that a white balance correction could have eliminated the yellow tint of the light and the picture seems a bit dark. I think a higher key shot might make this pop a bit more. There also seems to be excessive noise in the shadows and this could be from trying to fix the lighting in PS.</td>', 'I like the use of shadow and compositon in this shot but the lighting seesm a bit off. I feel that a white balance correction could have eliminated the yellow tint of the light and the picture seems a bit dark. I think a higher key shot might make this pop a bit more. There also seems to be excessive noise in the shadows and this could be from trying to fix the lighting in PS.', '2008-03-01 09:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529831, 651613, 48697, '<td valign="top">nice smoke shot and very well done transition of colors. I do feel that this might have more impact if it were all b&amp;w smoke or less color than used.</td>', 'nice smoke shot and very well done transition of colors. I do feel that this might have more impact if it were all b&w smoke or less color than used.', '2008-03-01 09:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529834, 651758, 48697, '<td valign="top">I feel that this shadows cast by the front eggs obscures the back eggs a bit too much. I think that raising the light source a bit would have cut that down and provided a more even lighting. I''m not sure if you wanted the blue cast on the eggs but it looks as if the white balance is off and too cool.</td>', 'I feel that this shadows cast by the front eggs obscures the back eggs a bit too much. I think that raising the light source a bit would have cut that down and provided a more even lighting. I''m not sure if you wanted the blue cast on the eggs but it looks as if the white balance is off and too cool.', '2008-03-01 09:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529836, 651541, 48697, '<td valign="top">This seems a bit too dark. I''m sure that you were going for the darker look but it is almost to the point of not being able to make out what the shape is. I shuter to think what those with uncalibrated monitors are leaving you as comments.</td>', 'This seems a bit too dark. I''m sure that you were going for the darker look but it is almost to the point of not being able to make out what the shape is. I shuter to think what those with uncalibrated monitors are leaving you as comments.', '2008-03-01 09:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529841, 651090, 48697, '<td valign="top">love the lines and compositon in this shot as well as the perspective, wel ldone!</td>', 'love the lines and compositon in this shot as well as the perspective, wel ldone!', '2008-03-01 09:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529843, 651920, 48697, '<td valign="top">great action capture! Maybe bump the brightness just a tad but still nicely done.</td>', 'great action capture! Maybe bump the brightness just a tad but still nicely done.', '2008-03-01 09:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529850, 651711, 48697, '<td valign="top">Very cool! I love how the horizon just disappears and a great natural b&amp;w, well done!</td>', 'Very cool! I love how the horizon just disappears and a great natural b&w, well done!', '2008-03-01 09:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529978, 651920, 46177, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture, I love the soft misty feel to it. 10</td>', 'Wonderful capture, I love the soft misty feel to it. 10', '2008-03-01 10:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529979, 651734, 46177, '<td valign="top">Very simple but perfect! 10</td>', 'Very simple but perfect! 10', '2008-03-01 10:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
