(4531203, 651828, 43774, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites! You may be getting comments that this is black &amp; blue, not black &amp; white, but that doesn''t bother me.</td>', 'One of my favourites! You may be getting comments that this is black & blue, not black & white, but that doesn''t bother me.', '2008-03-01 18:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
