(4531280, 650578, 7743, '<td valign="top">Good choice to show black and white, but ....<br/> <br/>1) lighting seems flat<br/>2) too much foreground.  The trees have much more interest so show more trees and sky and less foreground.  This would put the ducks less central and make the image more dynamic</td>', 'Good choice to show black and white, but .... 1) lighting seems flat2) too much foreground.  The trees have much more interest so show more trees and sky and less foreground.  This would put the ducks less central and make the image more dynamic', '2008-03-01 19:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4531365, 651964, 27556, '<td valign="top">I like the composition the way it is peeking out of the bag.</td>', 'I like the composition the way it is peeking out of the bag.', '2008-03-01 20:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4531367, 651747, 27556, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but even though it is a photo it reminds me of a 2D drawing or painting. there are no shadows so there is no depth. I know that is its the look and feel you were tring to achieve, but for my eye I enjoy more dimension</td>', 'nice idea, but even though it is a photo it reminds me of a 2D drawing or painting. there are no shadows so there is no depth. I know that is its the look and feel you were tring to achieve, but for my eye I enjoy more dimension', '2008-03-01 20:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4531370, 651783, 27556, '<td valign="top">The focus on this needs work. It seems like the central focus was on the back wall, IMHO it should have been either on the person or the building</td>', 'The focus on this needs work. It seems like the central focus was on the back wall, IMHO it should have been either on the person or the building', '2008-03-01 20:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4531371, 651107, 27556, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting... the way he is fading away in to the darkness, its really showing the duality to human nature.</td>', 'I love the lighting... the way he is fading away in to the darkness, its really showing the duality to human nature.', '2008-03-01 20:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4531374, 651920, 27556, '<td valign="top">The birds need to "pop" out off the background, the shot is so grey that they are not standing out enough. However that is a great capture of the motion,</td>', 'The birds need to "pop" out off the background, the shot is so grey that they are not standing out enough. However that is a great capture of the motion,', '2008-03-01 20:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4531380, 651933, 27556, '<td valign="top">This is a very clean shot, Personally I feel it would have benifited by not having the reflection on the bottom of the dish.</td>', 'This is a very clean shot, Personally I feel it would have benifited by not having the reflection on the bottom of the dish.', '2008-03-01 20:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4531382, 650156, 27556, '<td valign="top">A shot like this I would have liked to perfectly centered. The border is a nice touch but at the same time it makes me wonder what happened to his head.</td>', 'A shot like this I would have liked to perfectly centered. The border is a nice touch but at the same time it makes me wonder what happened to his head.', '2008-03-01 20:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4531387, 650463, 27556, '<td valign="top">This is structurally interesting. I love all of the different lines that are created by the circle and the human form. The border compliments this nicely.</td>', 'This is structurally interesting. I love all of the different lines that are created by the circle and the human form. The border compliments this nicely.', '2008-03-01 20:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4531393, 651706, 27556, '<td valign="top">This building is interesting, and looks like it propabablly has a story too it, but it is blending in to the sky. this is making the picture very flat. I would suggest work on post processing a little more to get it to stand out a bit more.</td>', 'This building is interesting, and looks like it propabablly has a story too it, but it is blending in to the sky. this is making the picture very flat. I would suggest work on post processing a little more to get it to stand out a bit more.', '2008-03-01 20:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4531432, 651704, 90425, '<td valign="top">VERY CREATIVE</td>', 'VERY CREATIVE', '2008-03-01 20:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4531645, 650122, 88054, '<td valign="top">Love the concept and the salt/pepper hair but too much color for me in this challenge. A close crop on the face with a black or white shirt would have been great. especially with all the smoke. Close but no cigar:)<br/> <br/>I think this would be an awesome portrait with a little photoshop work. Take the top 1/2 of the photo, blur the background just a bit and convert to black and white.  The light from the match will add a soft glow. Just a thought.</td>', 'Love the concept and the salt/pepper hair but too much color for me in this challenge. A close crop on the face with a black or white shirt would have been great. especially with all the smoke. Close but no cigar:) I think this would be an awesome portrait with a little photoshop work. Take the top 1/2 of the photo, blur the background just a bit and convert to black and white.  The light from the match will add a soft glow. Just a thought.', '2008-03-01 23:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4531648, 650547, 88054, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo. The water almost looks frozen.</td>', 'This is a great photo. The water almost looks frozen.', '2008-03-01 23:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4531649, 651704, 88054, '<td valign="top">Very clever. Love the vivid imagination.</td>', 'Very clever. Love the vivid imagination.', '2008-03-01 23:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4531674, 651613, 83375, '<td valign="top">Wasn''t the whole point to have it look b&amp;w? Why add color?</td>', 'Wasn''t the whole point to have it look b&w? Why add color?', '2008-03-01 23:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
