(4535273, 651740, 27556, '<td valign="top">This shot reminds me of 30 Days of night. The isolated snowy road to nowhere. the grey sky. I think this could benifit from a bit more post porcessing though. It might just need a bit of adjusting in curves.</td>', 'This shot reminds me of 30 Days of night. The isolated snowy road to nowhere. the grey sky. I think this could benifit from a bit more post porcessing though. It might just need a bit of adjusting in curves.', '2008-03-03 12:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
