(4538057, 649911, 80458, '<td valign="top">in my opinion, DNMC. The point was to capture the black and white and the red umbrella is what sticks out the most.</td>', 'in my opinion, DNMC. The point was to capture the black and white and the red umbrella is what sticks out the most.', '2008-03-04 16:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538060, 651404, 80458, '<td valign="top">This is just a really really nice photo. I love the composition.</td>', 'This is just a really really nice photo. I love the composition.', '2008-03-04 16:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538138, 651704, 61961, '<td valign="top">I know I''ve seen this photo somewhere (or one very similar).  Anyway, fits the theme well, good monotone feel.</td>', 'I know I''ve seen this photo somewhere (or one very similar).  Anyway, fits the theme well, good monotone feel.', '2008-03-04 17:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538140, 651963, 48954, '<td valign="top">funny, i just bought that movie a few days ago. cool shot.</td>', 'funny, i just bought that movie a few days ago. cool shot.', '2008-03-04 17:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538186, 649239, 68035, '<td valign="top">Brilliant photo, both in terms of the competition and as an image in its own right.  Very powerful blacks and white and wonderfully composed with the leading line of dragged feet in the snow.  Bleak yet somehow clean and inspiring.  One of my top three in the challenge.  Bumping to 10</td>', 'Brilliant photo, both in terms of the competition and as an image in its own right.  Very powerful blacks and white and wonderfully composed with the leading line of dragged feet in the snow.  Bleak yet somehow clean and inspiring.  One of my top three in the challenge.  Bumping to 10', '2008-03-04 17:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538192, 649666, 68035, '<td valign="top">OK, after last weeks pet portraits if you had told me that an image of an animal would be in my top three sor this challenge I would have called you mad....but I would have been wrong.<br/> <br/>This is one of the best pet images that I have ever seen, wonderful composition with the dogs back creating a strong leading light<br/> <br/>Really strong black and whites and the sunlight on the snow really does work well here<br/> <br/>Superb and bumping to 10</td>', 'OK, after last weeks pet portraits if you had told me that an image of an animal would be in my top three sor this challenge I would have called you mad....but I would have been wrong. This is one of the best pet images that I have ever seen, wonderful composition with the dogs back creating a strong leading light Really strong black and whites and the sunlight on the snow really does work well here Superb and bumping to 10', '2008-03-04 17:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538196, 651162, 68035, '<td valign="top">Simplicity yes...beauty definitely<br/> <br/>Great use of minimalism, contrast, negative space and leading lines makes this one of my three favourites in the challenge.<br/> <br/>This image would grace anyones wall<br/> <br/>A stunning shot which I hope does well for you - 9 from me</td>', 'Simplicity yes...beauty definitely Great use of minimalism, contrast, negative space and leading lines makes this one of my three favourites in the challenge. This image would grace anyones wall A stunning shot which I hope does well for you - 9 from me', '2008-03-04 17:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538201, 651726, 68035, '<td valign="top">Is say either in Paris or hiding underneath Oprah Winfrey''s chair<br/> <br/>Superb shot that meets the challenge very well I love the symettry and sharpness of the imageand the skyline has created a great halo over the subject.  Bumping to 9 good luck</td>', 'Is say either in Paris or hiding underneath Oprah Winfrey''s chair Superb shot that meets the challenge very well I love the symettry and sharpness of the imageand the skyline has created a great halo over the subject.  Bumping to 9 good luck', '2008-03-04 18:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538208, 650244, 68035, '<td valign="top">OK there may be one moon shot where the subject is slightly brighter and clearer but yours is still the best of its kind (imo) in the competition because of the wonderfully dramatic tree line silhouetted on it and the very clever implied leading diagonal line.  Bumping to 9 great shot</td>', 'OK there may be one moon shot where the subject is slightly brighter and clearer but yours is still the best of its kind (imo) in the competition because of the wonderfully dramatic tree line silhouetted on it and the very clever implied leading diagonal line.  Bumping to 9 great shot', '2008-03-04 18:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538214, 651914, 68035, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image in terms of both the competiton as a shot I could happily look at no matter what the context I saw it in.  Great capture and composition in terms of the span of the bridgeand a very nice rippled reflection<br/> <br/>The sharpness of the branches compared to the ever so slightly softer bridge work well great picture.  Bumping to 9</td>', 'Wonderful image in terms of both the competiton as a shot I could happily look at no matter what the context I saw it in.  Great capture and composition in terms of the span of the bridgeand a very nice rippled reflection The sharpness of the branches compared to the ever so slightly softer bridge work well great picture.  Bumping to 9', '2008-03-04 18:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538233, 651958, 27556, '<td valign="top">This shot is a little to vaguefor me. I would have been more interested if the foot prints were distinguishable as animal, or human etc.</td>', 'This shot is a little to vaguefor me. I would have been more interested if the foot prints were distinguishable as animal, or human etc.', '2008-03-04 18:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538235, 649270, 27556, '<td valign="top">I love leather, but I dont see anythign special about this shot. Its as if these objects were laying around and gathered just for this shot since they happen to be black. Someones hand in one of the gloves would be far more interesting to look at than a pile of objects.</td>', 'I love leather, but I dont see anythign special about this shot. Its as if these objects were laying around and gathered just for this shot since they happen to be black. Someones hand in one of the gloves would be far more interesting to look at than a pile of objects.', '2008-03-04 18:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538236, 649325, 27556, '<td valign="top">The content of this shot is not really working for me. Outside of this challenge perhapse if it was actually desaturated it might work better, but as is, just not working</td>', 'The content of this shot is not really working for me. Outside of this challenge perhapse if it was actually desaturated it might work better, but as is, just not working', '2008-03-04 18:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538237, 650578, 27556, '<td valign="top">The picture is not in focus, the subject is dead center wich is not very interesting. Try taking pictures using the rule of thirds, or experiment with different angles sometimes seeing somethign in a new way makes the oject totally new.</td>', 'The picture is not in focus, the subject is dead center wich is not very interesting. Try taking pictures using the rule of thirds, or experiment with different angles sometimes seeing somethign in a new way makes the oject totally new.', '2008-03-04 18:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538238, 650354, 27556, '<td valign="top">The content in this shot is very flat, and there is not much going on.</td>', 'The content in this shot is very flat, and there is not much going on.', '2008-03-04 18:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538240, 651936, 27556, '<td valign="top">simple and clean... but maybe too simple</td>', 'simple and clean... but maybe too simple', '2008-03-04 18:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538241, 650367, 27556, '<td valign="top">This looks like a shot real estate agents post on their web sites. For an artistic photo I tend to find that various angles tend to bring more character to the building</td>', 'This looks like a shot real estate agents post on their web sites. For an artistic photo I tend to find that various angles tend to bring more character to the building', '2008-03-04 18:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
