(4538244, 649739, 27556, '<td valign="top">i dont like the orientation of this shot. I would like to see more of the bird in the air or just the grounded birds</td>', 'i dont like the orientation of this shot. I would like to see more of the bird in the air or just the grounded birds', '2008-03-04 18:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
