(4538248, 651178, 27556, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but i dont like the way the motion was exicuted between the two arms are the trails either emphasize them or get rid of them, I dont like the way they are just slightly there.</td>', 'Nice idea, but i dont like the way the motion was exicuted between the two arms are the trails either emphasize them or get rid of them, I dont like the way they are just slightly there.', '2008-03-04 18:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
