(4538695, 650391, 48697, '<td valign="top">Wow, very creative. The beauty behind this shot is if you step across the room and look at this or cross your eyes it really is gray. You get a ten from me as I can''t image how you get more "black and white in color than this", awsome job!</td>', 'Wow, very creative. The beauty behind this shot is if you step across the room and look at this or cross your eyes it really is gray. You get a ten from me as I can''t image how you get more "black and white in color than this", awsome job!', '2008-03-04 21:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538700, 649264, 65234, '<td valign="top">OK, it''s a toy, but you made me laugh.  Great lighting; if it weren''t for the ridge where the neck fits into the body it would look almost realistic.  At least as realistic as any other alien.</td>', 'OK, it''s a toy, but you made me laugh.  Great lighting; if it weren''t for the ridge where the neck fits into the body it would look almost realistic.  At least as realistic as any other alien.', '2008-03-04 21:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538703, 651860, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like a wonderful old building.</td>', 'Looks like a wonderful old building.', '2008-03-04 21:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538709, 651716, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice burst in that light reflection on the end of the bottom screw.  They look almost jewel-like with the lighting.</td>', 'Nice burst in that light reflection on the end of the bottom screw.  They look almost jewel-like with the lighting.', '2008-03-04 21:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538712, 650779, 65234, '<td valign="top">Ew.  There are times when I don''t really want a lot of detail.  This is one of them.  If I ignore what''s in his mouth it''s a nice shot ;-)</td>', 'Ew.  There are times when I don''t really want a lot of detail.  This is one of them.  If I ignore what''s in his mouth it''s a nice shot ;-)', '2008-03-04 21:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538715, 652055, 65234, '<td valign="top">If you''re going to do it, do it well.  You did.  Not often that I can see texture in a moon shot.</td>', 'If you''re going to do it, do it well.  You did.  Not often that I can see texture in a moon shot.', '2008-03-04 21:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538718, 651182, 48697, '<td valign="top">Larus? Awsome lighting, looks cold and warm at the same time, well done.</td>', 'Larus? Awsome lighting, looks cold and warm at the same time, well done.', '2008-03-04 21:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538720, 651799, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  Love the hair and the lighting.</td>', 'Very cute.  Love the hair and the lighting.', '2008-03-04 21:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538723, 649204, 48697, '<td valign="top">I like the crop in this shot as well as the contre jour lighting, nice.</td>', 'I like the crop in this shot as well as the contre jour lighting, nice.', '2008-03-04 21:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538724, 652027, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely steam and wonderful sense of peace to this.  That little bit of light showing me the rim on the left is perfect.</td>', 'Lovely steam and wonderful sense of peace to this.  That little bit of light showing me the rim on the left is perfect.', '2008-03-04 21:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538729, 649987, 48697, '<td valign="top">I feel that the lighitng in this is a bit harsh.</td>', 'I feel that the lighitng in this is a bit harsh.', '2008-03-04 21:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538730, 652027, 39349, '<td valign="top">Very nice, love the steam coming off the top.</td>', 'Very nice, love the steam coming off the top.', '2008-03-04 21:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
