(4539812, 650329, 69368, '<td valign="top">oh, place 81? Can''t believe it!<br/>I think, it meets the challenge.It''s also a very good composition, nice lighting, good sharpness. I like this pic!</td>', 'oh, place 81? Can''t believe it!I think, it meets the challenge.It''s also a very good composition, nice lighting, good sharpness. I like this pic!', '2008-03-05 05:40:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4539820, 651404, 310, '<td valign="top">Big congrats, June! this is fantastic</td>', 'Big congrats, June! this is fantastic', '2008-03-05 05:53:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4539834, 651939, 41337, '<td valign="top">You know it wouldn''t surprise me if Congress did do that but not before they had unnecessary hearings first. :P Congrats Jeffrey. Very creative. I''m surprised it didn''t do better. I think if you had shown your face and maybe shown a goofy expression (ex. a surprised look/bug eyes) you may have gotten some extra points.</td>', 'You know it wouldn''t surprise me if Congress did do that but not before they had unnecessary hearings first. :P Congrats Jeffrey. Very creative. I''m surprised it didn''t do better. I think if you had shown your face and maybe shown a goofy expression (ex. a surprised look/bug eyes) you may have gotten some extra points.', '2008-03-05 06:11:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4539870, 650099, 53147, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and great score considering you had color in it. Those that took the challenge to the extreme of having to have absolutley no color are just a bit anal. If this were mine I would have probably pimped out the eyes even more to make the color pop. But I guess I am a rebel that way. ;)<br/> <br/>Very nice work, very nice score, ignore the votes of 2.</td>', 'Nice shot and great score considering you had color in it. Those that took the challenge to the extreme of having to have absolutley no color are just a bit anal. If this were mine I would have probably pimped out the eyes even more to make the color pop. But I guess I am a rebel that way. ;) Very nice work, very nice score, ignore the votes of 2.', '2008-03-05 06:52:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4539876, 651172, 30982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, Andi, and perfect for the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful, Andi, and perfect for the challenge.', '2008-03-05 06:59:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4539879, 651706, 30982, '<td valign="top">You are on a roll!  Lovely shot - perfectly composed, great tones and contrast, and an excellent title.</td>', 'You are on a roll!  Lovely shot - perfectly composed, great tones and contrast, and an excellent title.', '2008-03-05 07:00:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4539880, 651735, 53147, '<td valign="top">I dont mind the tilt so much, though straight up and down probably would have worked too. That or having the ball title straight on the horizon. The extra tilt of that makes the shot feel a bit off balance - minor issue though. Great idea. Nice clean detail on the glass top and ball. My main issue is the stem dissappearing in to the background. I love the look of the base but the stem blending in totally feels odd. The white background has a cool, smooth feel to it and I think I wish either the whole background was that or that the stem was clear glass over black so that there is some separation. Overall a very good experimentation for you Deb. Good idea, good execution. You will be shooting eye candy before you know it. ;)<br/> <br/>And hello right back at ya.</td>', 'I dont mind the tilt so much, though straight up and down probably would have worked too. That or having the ball title straight on the horizon. The extra tilt of that makes the shot feel a bit off balance - minor issue though. Great idea. Nice clean detail on the glass top and ball. My main issue is the stem dissappearing in to the background. I love the look of the base but the stem blending in totally feels odd. The white background has a cool, smooth feel to it and I think I wish either the whole background was that or that the stem was clear glass over black so that there is some separation. Overall a very good experimentation for you Deb. Good idea, good execution. You will be shooting eye candy before you know it. ;) And hello right back at ya.', '2008-03-05 07:00:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4539884, 650329, 53147, '<td valign="top">I expected to see this much higher. Love how he blends into the background, Very nice.</td>', 'I expected to see this much higher. Love how he blends into the background, Very nice.', '2008-03-05 07:01:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4539885, 650249, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot - congratulations on the great score and the secret colour ribbon!</td>', 'Wonderful shot - congratulations on the great score and the secret colour ribbon!', '2008-03-05 07:02:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4539894, 652049, 51538, '<td valign="top">Luscious texture there.</td>', 'Luscious texture there.', '2008-03-05 07:07:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4539922, 650391, 28261, '<td valign="top">I was one of the three.<br/> <br/>This image was far underrated, showing a brilliant use of color and greyscale to exemplify what the challenge REALLY meant to me.  Use color to spotlight a black and white subject.  Perhaps the reverse of that (using black and white with a colorized main focal point) is what forced so many to hammer this image.<br/> <br/>I''m thinking it should be oobie''d.</td>', 'I was one of the three. This image was far underrated, showing a brilliant use of color and greyscale to exemplify what the challenge REALLY meant to me.  Use color to spotlight a black and white subject.  Perhaps the reverse of that (using black and white with a colorized main focal point) is what forced so many to hammer this image. I''m thinking it should be oobie''d.', '2008-03-05 07:31:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4539931, 650156, 1024, '<td valign="top">Yes it is truly unfortunate that the Liberty Bell is not in Washington DC.  Perhaps the 2 of you can plan your next trip to Philadelphia ;-)<br/> <br/>I gave this photo one of its 10''s.  I know this memorial so well, but never saw this particular angle.  Wonderfully done, great detail and texture.</td>', 'Yes it is truly unfortunate that the Liberty Bell is not in Washington DC.  Perhaps the 2 of you can plan your next trip to Philadelphia ;-) I gave this photo one of its 10''s.  I know this memorial so well, but never saw this particular angle.  Wonderfully done, great detail and texture.', '2008-03-05 07:37:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4539932, 651711, 30237, '<td valign="top">Your picture really captures a winter mood. Congratulations.</td>', 'Your picture really captures a winter mood. Congratulations.', '2008-03-05 07:39:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4539933, 650510, 1024, '<td valign="top">Of all the memorials in Washington DC, this is the one that is closest to my heart.  I think you have captured it in a new and very creative way.  this is worthy of a Posthumous award.</td>', 'Of all the memorials in Washington DC, this is the one that is closest to my heart.  I think you have captured it in a new and very creative way.  this is worthy of a Posthumous award.', '2008-03-05 07:40:05.000000', NULL, 0),
