(4539956, 651404, 66494, '<td valign="top">Man, that is awesome. I wish I would have voted the challenge, you''d have gotten another 10 from me. Congrats on your great finish, but better yet, congratulations on a beautiful photo.</td>', 'Man, that is awesome. I wish I would have voted the challenge, you''d have gotten another 10 from me. Congrats on your great finish, but better yet, congratulations on a beautiful photo.', '2008-03-05 08:05:13.000000', NULL, 0),
