(4539972, 651706, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great job Terry and nice score.</td>', 'Great job Terry and nice score.', '2008-03-05 08:13:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4539980, 651939, 66597, '<td valign="top">Congrats on making the front page, Jeffrey! I love this and am not at all surprised by your awesome score.</td>', 'Congrats on making the front page, Jeffrey! I love this and am not at all surprised by your awesome score.', '2008-03-05 08:22:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4539981, 651979, 66597, '<td valign="top">Well Don, I was one of your 9''s, and would give you the Posthumous award if I could, LOL. Utterly fantastic. I love the movement here. The only thing (and it''s a nit) that kept me from a 10 is the curving line at the top - it breaks up the continuity for me. BTW - the grass at the bottom looks like writing in a beautiful script. I think this has to go into faves.</td>', 'Well Don, I was one of your 9''s, and would give you the Posthumous award if I could, LOL. Utterly fantastic. I love the movement here. The only thing (and it''s a nit) that kept me from a 10 is the curving line at the top - it breaks up the continuity for me. BTW - the grass at the bottom looks like writing in a beautiful script. I think this has to go into faves.', '2008-03-05 08:25:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4539984, 651759, 66597, '<td valign="top">Peter, people should be more open-minded. This is a fabulous interpretation of the challenge. Sure, the background is a bit distracting, but it is a most interesting shot with more layers than the eye candy often seen here.</td>', 'Peter, people should be more open-minded. This is a fabulous interpretation of the challenge. Sure, the background is a bit distracting, but it is a most interesting shot with more layers than the eye candy often seen here.', '2008-03-05 08:27:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4539989, 649922, 80904, '<td valign="top">OMG Slippy won a ribbon! Everyone start going to your local nuclear shelter. The world is going to end!<br/> <br/>Gratz Slippy on your ribbon. That shot is a great one.</td>', 'OMG Slippy won a ribbon! Everyone start going to your local nuclear shelter. The world is going to end! Gratz Slippy on your ribbon. That shot is a great one.', '2008-03-05 08:30:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4539991, 650610, 66597, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge with a creative idea. It is well composed and well lit. The slightly blown highlights aren''t troublesome here. I think it may have scored even better if the viewer had more of a feeling of interaction with the two people, but the tight crop does show the master''s belt well.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge with a creative idea. It is well composed and well lit. The slightly blown highlights aren''t troublesome here. I think it may have scored even better if the viewer had more of a feeling of interaction with the two people, but the tight crop does show the master''s belt well.', '2008-03-05 08:30:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4540005, 651734, 73235, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Christiane. It really is what you say, schlicht und einfach - schoen</td>', 'Congratulations Christiane. It really is what you say, schlicht und einfach - schoen', '2008-03-05 08:40:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4540018, 651162, 35357, '<td valign="top">Coolio!  I love the space and..... simplicity!</td>', 'Coolio!  I love the space and..... simplicity!', '2008-03-05 08:47:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4540031, 651914, 35357, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I like the contrasty detailed natural fractals fading to mistiness, and the strong man-made arch and lines, all reflected.  A beautiful scene, well seen.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I like the contrasty detailed natural fractals fading to mistiness, and the strong man-made arch and lines, all reflected.  A beautiful scene, well seen.', '2008-03-05 08:53:04.000000', NULL, 0),
