(4540494, 651738, 80058, '<td valign="top">Thanks Sandy and wronp, and all other commenters they all gave me good scores  =D <br/> <br/>That saucer and mug have a cow spot design so I thought I''d go along with it, so I traced the designs with tracing paper, transfered that into white paper then cut it out... then placed it on the black card I was using for the background. Wanted to work with a positive/negative theme I guess that considering it''s an abstract shot it did fairly well, not sure everyone could see what it was though</td>', 'Thanks Sandy and wronp, and all other commenters they all gave me good scores  =D  That saucer and mug have a cow spot design so I thought I''d go along with it, so I traced the designs with tracing paper, transfered that into white paper then cut it out... then placed it on the black card I was using for the background. Wanted to work with a positive/negative theme I guess that considering it''s an abstract shot it did fairly well, not sure everyone could see what it was though', '2008-03-05 11:22:21.000000', NULL, 0),
