(4541311, 650610, 68035, '<td valign="top">Hey what are you doing going to a Japanese Festival...you are meant to be in Team America....Was there not a monster truck rally you could have visited<br/> <br/>I really like this shot, the crispness of the white, and the great contrast of the ''black'' (in parts) belt gives this a real 3d feel to it.  Super sharpness on the belt gives it a great textured feel and this works well with the bokeh<br/> <br/>Very nice image</td>', 'Hey what are you doing going to a Japanese Festival...you are meant to be in Team America....Was there not a monster truck rally you could have visited I really like this shot, the crispness of the white, and the great contrast of the ''black'' (in parts) belt gives this a real 3d feel to it.  Super sharpness on the belt gives it a great textured feel and this works well with the bokeh Very nice image', '2008-03-05 16:33:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4541318, 651068, 68035, '<td valign="top">Roz, I really do feel on you on your DQ.  I thought this was a carcking shot and I loved the PP on the dress that gave it a real luminous glow.<br/> <br/>Not a ''pretty'' picture, but then despair seldom is, but very sympathetically portrayed.  Dramatic without sinking into melodrama<br/> <br/>Regardless of the fact that this got DQ''s you should be very proud of another great image</td>', 'Roz, I really do feel on you on your DQ.  I thought this was a carcking shot and I loved the PP on the dress that gave it a real luminous glow. Not a ''pretty'' picture, but then despair seldom is, but very sympathetically portrayed.  Dramatic without sinking into melodrama Regardless of the fact that this got DQ''s you should be very proud of another great image', '2008-03-05 16:37:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4541334, 650510, 68035, '<td valign="top">I TOLD you we should have photographed the Liberty Bell!!!<br/> <br/>I really cant believe that this did not score better although the fact that 17 people scored it 7 or higher does show that there were people out there who really liked it<br/> <br/>I love the fact that you managed to catch so much of the etched faces and bodies on the memorial together with glimpses of the reflections of the statues behind it<br/> <br/>A great memory of a lovely day<br/> <br/></td>', 'I TOLD you we should have photographed the Liberty Bell!!! I really cant believe that this did not score better although the fact that 17 people scored it 7 or higher does show that there were people out there who really liked it I love the fact that you managed to catch so much of the etched faces and bodies on the memorial together with glimpses of the reflections of the statues behind it A great memory of a lovely day ', '2008-03-05 16:46:15.000000', NULL, 0),
