(4543521, 651979, 40683, '<td valign="top">I love every blurry one of them.  Most of all I love your comment: "I don''t really care if it''s not black and white enough for some people, because I''m in love with this photo, and love is blind."  :D</td>', 'I love every blurry one of them.  Most of all I love your comment: "I don''t really care if it''s not black and white enough for some people, because I''m in love with this photo, and love is blind."  :D', '2008-03-06 14:34:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4543770, 650391, 66193, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by johst582:</b></div><hr/><i> Pardon me, but what does "oobied" mean? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>An Oobie is an informal award given for an entry that is OOB (out of the box, meaning not your typical take on the challenge).  this image certainly qualifies for that!  well done!</td>', 'Originally posted by johst582: Pardon me, but what does "oobied" mean?   An Oobie is an informal award given for an entry that is OOB (out of the box, meaning not your typical take on the challenge).  this image certainly qualifies for that!  well done!', '2008-03-06 16:48:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4544350, 651068, 44877, '<td valign="top">Aw Roz!! I just saw this - it''s horrible. Second time now that you''ve fallen victim of some bizarre communication - or lack thereof - what a shame. Don''t be discouraged, though. For one, this is a brilliant image, regardless of the DQ and whether it was justified or not. This is an island, but your images reach far beyond nitpicky stuff like why this entry was disqualified. <br/> <br/>Onward, sister!! You are an inspiration to us all!<br/> <br/>OXOXO Alicia</td>', 'Aw Roz!! I just saw this - it''s horrible. Second time now that you''ve fallen victim of some bizarre communication - or lack thereof - what a shame. Don''t be discouraged, though. For one, this is a brilliant image, regardless of the DQ and whether it was justified or not. This is an island, but your images reach far beyond nitpicky stuff like why this entry was disqualified.  Onward, sister!! You are an inspiration to us all! OXOXO Alicia', '2008-03-06 22:22:47.000000', NULL, 0),
