(4550009, 649757, 84440, '<td valign="top">This is a powerful image. I think the reason that it didn''t fair better was that it is dark. You shot raw, you could have increase exposure by 1/3 to 1/2 stop without losing too much range. regards, lg</td>', 'This is a powerful image. I think the reason that it didn''t fair better was that it is dark. You shot raw, you could have increase exposure by 1/3 to 1/2 stop without losing too much range. regards, lg', '2008-03-09 13:13:57.000000', NULL, 0),
