(5085134, 651711, 12611, '<td valign="top">I love this shot; this is a great example of how photographic technique stands out in the visual arts; the contrast, the detail ...fantastic.</td>', 'I love this shot; this is a great example of how photographic technique stands out in the visual arts; the contrast, the detail ...fantastic.', '2008-11-26 07:08:18.000000', NULL, 0),
